# Project Detail Page & Form Enhancements

## Overview
This update addresses the "Whitescreen" crash on the Project Detail Page and enhances the Project and Task creation forms to support comprehensive data entry (Dates, Status).

## Changes

### 1. Fix Blank Screen (Project Detail Page)
- **Root Cause**: The application was crashing due to `RangeError: Invalid time value` when attempting to format `null` or invalid date strings using `date-fns` in the Project Stats grid.
- **Fix**: Implemented a [safeFormat](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Documents/Coding/SynapsePlan/frontend/src/pages/projectDetailPage.tsx#33-38) helper function in `ProjectDetailPage.tsx`.
- **Logic**:
  ```typescript
  const safeFormat = (dateStr: string | undefined, fmt: string) => {
    if (!dateStr) return 'Not set';
    const d = new Date(dateStr);
    return isValid(d) ? format(d, fmt) : 'Invalid Date';
  };
  ```
- **Result**: Page now renders robustly even with missing data.

### 2. Enhanced Creation Forms
- **Goal**: Allow users to input Start Date, End Date, and Status during creation.
- **Components Updated**:
  - [CreateProjectModal.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Documents/Coding/SynapsePlan/frontend/src/components/projects/CreateProjectModal.tsx)
  - [CreateTaskModal.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Documents/Coding/SynapsePlan/frontend/src/components/tasks/CreateTaskModal.tsx)
- **Features**:
  - Added native Date Pickers (styled with MUI).
  - Added Status Dropdown (Not Started, In Progress, Completed, On Hold).
  - Updated API services ([createProject](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Documents/Coding/SynapsePlan/frontend/src/services/projects.ts#23-38), [createTask](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Documents/Coding/SynapsePlan/frontend/src/services/tasks.ts#24-28)) to transmit these fields.

